{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/1430413-cofd-crossover-discord-game","id":1430413,"title":"CofD Crossover Discord Game","path":["Home","Onyx Path","General","Conventions, Gatherings, and Online Play"],"posts":[{"date":"2020-12-29T21:29:22-08:00","id":1430413,"title":"CofD Crossover Discord Game","content":"I am running a game on discord that needs more players. Additional STs are also more than welcome. The game is a crossover, with the Vampire, Werewolf, Mage, Changeling, Demon and Geist splats. Others may be added if I can find another ST who wants to run them.<br /> <br /> Without going into obsessive detail about the setting, I will say that the main premise is inspired by &quot;The Pit of the Nameless&quot; story hook in Requiem, along with hooks from the God Machine Chronicle, Mage, Demon, and more. The game itself has been going for a little while now, and we are ready for some new blood. To avoid spoilers though, Im keeping this short and sweet.<br /> <br /> If anyone is interested, feel free to contact me at GraySkies#0162 on Discord, we'd love to have some new folks to join us.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25606-serpentking","name":"SerpentKing","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar25606_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-12-09T15:48:53-08:00","id":1526573,"title":"","content":"Hey all!<br /> After a bit of a hiatus my crew and I have been preparing for a new game (still CofD) in a cyberpunk setting. Hoping to find a few more people interested in joining us. As before, the game is a crossover with many of the splats (Vampire, Werewolf, Mage, Changeling, Demon, Geist and now Beast) and have no problem adding others if we can find someone who wants to ST them. The game is play-by-post although it may extend to Roll20 for map placement. The premise:<br /> <br /> <br /> <img data-align=\"none\" data-size=\"full\" loading=\"lazy\" border=\"0\" src=\"https://imgur.com/BN0U42G\" alt=\"\" data-fullsize-url=\"https://imgur.com/BN0U42G\" data-thumb-url=\"https://imgur.com/BN0U42G\" data-title=\"Click on the image to see the original version\" data-caption=\"\" class=\"bbcode-attachment thumbnail js-lightbox bbcode-attachment--lightbox\" itemprop=\"image\"/><img data-align=\"none\" data-size=\"full\" loading=\"lazy\" border=\"0\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/BN0U42G.jpg\" alt=\"\" data-fullsize-url=\"https://i.imgur.com/BN0U42G.jpg\" data-thumb-url=\"https://i.imgur.com/BN0U42G.jpg\" data-title=\"Click on the image to see the original version\" data-caption=\"\" class=\"bbcode-attachment thumbnail js-lightbox bbcode-attachment--lightbox\" itemprop=\"image\"/><br /> <br /> It is the year 25XX, and humanity has come far. Colonies across the solar system bring in new research, new technologies, new resources that should empower mankind. However, in America at least, democracy as fallen and been replaced by a corporate oligarchy, which every hypercorporation functioning as it\u2019s own nation with it\u2019s own laws. Each city then becomes a conglomerate of whichever corporations have the most dominance in local areas.<br /> <br /> <br /> The Stillwater Orbital Lift dominates the city, so much so that the city has grown upwards around it. Now the city isn\u2019t just one, but four, layered one on top of each other, including the underground stratum known colloquially as the Pit. The ground stratum is known as Stillwater, while first and second stratum, known as The Mezzanine and Stillsky respectively dominate the sky and shadowing everything beneath. The distinction between the wealthy and the poor has never been so prominent, with the most unfortunates forced into the oily depths of the Pit, while the affluent and powerful reign supreme on the second stratum.<br /> <br /> <br /> In Stillwater, the most notable corporations are: Basilisk: known for the new and terrifying weaponry and military applications, Sundog: The main corporation in control of local space travel and tourism, ConGo: transportation and mailing services , Infiniti: artificial intelligence, robotics and cybernetics, Zipline: advertising, designer drugs, and social engineering and their rival Neurogenesis Labs, the leading producer of legal recreational drugs.<br /> <br /> <br /> Minor corps include Johnson^26 who are a generational dynasty practicing in law, Pogomag Factories: a Mining and waste management company who owns most of the Pit, Testapt which specializes in virtual entertainment and medicine.<br /> <br /> <br /> Despite the advance of time and the changes in technologies, regressive company policies, have kept dramatic changes suppressed so that the future is not so unrecognizable from the present: Advanced robotics exist but sentient androids are still far from a reality. Pistols are still the most common weapons available to the public and all the monsters of the dark are still a mystery to mortal consciousness.<br /> \u200b - - -<br /> <br /> Thanks for reading!<br /> If you're interested, message me on discord at: _grayskies","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25606-serpentking","name":"SerpentKing","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar25606_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}